  {
    "binding": "section",
    "check": "CI-04",
    "named_by_text": "A wrapper script a step runs (run: scripts/ci/test.sh), a reusable workflow a job calls and the CI doc that holds a report-only step's debt row are read at the paths the workflow or the repository's docs name.",
    "note": "The agent reads each job that runs a CI-02 verb or check for continue-on-error: true and a swallowed exit code (|| true, exit 0, set +e), following a composite action, a reusable workflow or a wrapper script into its file, then whether the declared branch rules (the HYG-11 files) require the job (audit/checks/06-ci.md, CI-04). A report-only step needs its debt record in the repository: a comment beside the step, its row in the CI doc or an entry in a committed counts file. A live read-only query needs the person's consent.",
    "source": "agent",
    "threshold": "every verb job gates and is a required status check",
    "what": {
      "kind": "key",
      "text": [
        "continue-on-error"
      ]
    },
    "where": [
